Z||000005||sully5||06-22-2000||08:03 AM||||84 Indy - Sorry it took so long, but haven't had much time to get on here. The part number for the bushings is 20586100. The hinge tab number is 20424246. Good luck with it. Changing everything was pretty easy. Really tightened the glass up nice, and cut down on rattling. TGOwens - there are 4 bushings total. ||||reg||1
